    "detailed_description": "<strong>DEITY DRIVING</strong> mushes adventure and arcade elements \u2013 drive around as a submissive car, bump into strangers and enjoy your involuntary vacation!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/8fe6cad625a201f1018aac2fe8e765fe.poster.avif?t=1579727135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/8fe6cad625a201f1018aac2fe8e765fe.webm?t=1579727135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/8fe6cad625a201f1018aac2fe8e765fe.mp4?t=1579727135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There are three different paths and endings, seeing them all takes about 20 to 30 minutes. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/518a4065a283afcb6036e9ac1d880f5c.avif?t=1579727135\" /></div><br><br><i>Features:</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully voiced<br></li><li>A relaxed ride with dogs and demons</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2.5D movement<br></li><li>Realistic sock physics<br></li><li>Approved by the Quirk Police (&quot;Not too quirky, B-&quot;)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>DEITY DRIVING</strong> mushes adventure and arcade elements \u2013 drive around as a submissive car, bump into strangers and enjoy your involuntary vacation!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/8fe6cad625a201f1018aac2fe8e765fe.poster.avif?t=1579727135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/8fe6cad625a201f1018aac2fe8e765fe.webm?t=1579727135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/8fe6cad625a201f1018aac2fe8e765fe.mp4?t=1579727135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There are three different paths and endings, seeing them all takes about 20 to 30 minutes. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213460/extras/518a4065a283afcb6036e9ac1d880f5c.avif?t=1579727135\" /></div><br><br><i>Features:</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully voiced<br></li><li>A relaxed ride with dogs and demons</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2.5D movement<br></li><li>Realistic sock physics<br></li><li>Approved by the Quirk Police (&quot;Not too quirky, B-&quot;)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An adventure car game. A pleasure trip. A dubious method to get rid of superfluous braincells. Deity Driving!",
